<title>USA: Gensia sets record date, special meeting.</title>
<headline>Gensia sets record date, special meeting.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gensia Inc said stockholders of record on January 13, will be entitled to vote at a special meeting of stockholders on February 26, 1997.</p>
<p>The special meeting is being held to approve, among other proposals, the issuance of 29.5 million shares of Gensia common stock to acquire three specialty pharmaceutical businesses.</p>
<p>The businesses are SICOR (Societa Italiana Corticosteroidi) SpA of Milan, Italy, and two companies located in Mexico.</p>
